<title>USA: Accustaff acquires legal services provider.</title>
<headline>Accustaff acquires legal services provider.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>AccuStaff Inc said Thursday it had acquired Legal Information Technology Inc, a provider of legal support services, including document imaging and coding, to law firms and corporate law departments nationwide.  </p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Accustaff said in a release that Legal Information's revenues for 1996 are estimated at $10 million, based on unaudited results.</p>
